WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
 Imagine falling asleep nestled by nature.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.800
 Our Fair Trade farmers in the forests of Sri Lanka

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.920
 gently tap into the sustainable rubbitries

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.640
 collecting pure latex sap.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.640
 Every drop supports not only your comfort

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:19.840
 but also a thriving fair trade community

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:22.400
 that we are proud to stand behind.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.920
 The rubbitry sap takes a short trip from the forests

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.160
 to our factory in Colombo.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.720
 Our full sap is purified, especially at a small amount

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:36.760
 of binding ingredients and whip it into a frothy fluffy foam.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.600
 The foam is steamed baked at 212 degrees.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.520
 Think of it as the world's most comfy cake.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.800
 After rigorous quality controls,

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.400
 the foam blocks are then shaped to Illinois

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.800
 to become your new mattress.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.520
 In our Chicago factory, every detail matters.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.720
 Our 12 dedicated sewers place thousands of

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:00.960
 overlocking stitches, one by one.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.680
 Even on seams you'll never see.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.040
 Once the meticulous sewing is complete,

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.160
 our warehouse steam takes over.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:11.640
 The covers are quilted and assembled into each mattress.

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:15.880
 Then they are tested for comfort, durability and safety

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:17.920
 and then shipped to their new home.

